        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Mosiah 9:9",
        "book": "Mosiah",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "Now it was the cunning and the craftiness of king Laman, to bring my people into bondage, that he yielded up the land that we might possess it.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 50,
            "end": 55,
            "text": "Mosiah 24:3."
          },
          {
            "start": 60,
            "end": 65,
            "text": "Mosiah 7:22; 10:18."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Mosiah 24:3.",
            "prettyString": "Mosiah 24:3",
            "references": [
