        "book": "Mosiah",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 17
      },
      {
        "text": "And God did hear our cries and did answer our prayers; and we did go forth in his might; yea, we did go forth against the Lamanites, and in one day and a night we did slay three thousand and forty-three; we did slay them even until we had driven them out of our land.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 12,
            "end": 16,
            "text": "Ex. 2:24 (23–24); Ps. 4:1 (1, 3); Dan. 10:12; D&C 35:3; Abr. 1:15 (15–16)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 18,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
