        "book": "Mosiah",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 18
      },
      {
        "text": "And I, myself, with mine own hands, did help to bury their dead. And behold, to our great sorrow and lamentation, two hundred and seventy-nine of our brethren were slain.",
